{"seq":48,"slug":"api-gateway-service-mesh","title":"API 网关与服务网格","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/api-gateway-service-mesh","rating":{"composite":3.76,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# API 网关与服务网格\n\n微服务把一个单体拆成几十上百个进程，随之而来的不是某一个新问题，而是一整类「服务之间如何对话」的问题：外部请求怎么进来、内部调用怎么互信、流量怎么切、故障怎么隔离、整条链路怎么看清。API 网关与服务网格就是为回答这类问题而长出来的两套基础设施。它们常被混为一谈，但解决的是不同方向的流量，部署在不同的位置，归属于不同的团队。这个 hub 的任务，是把这两者的边界、机制与协同关系讲清楚。\n\n第一章「基础」先打地基。我们区分网关与网格各自管什么，再引入贯穿全 hub 的核心坐标——南北流量与东西流量，最后下沉到两者共用的底层零件：代理。无论网关还是网格的数据面，本质都是一个被精心配置的代理（多半是 Envoy），所以代理的工作原理是后面所有章节的公共词汇表。\n\n第二章「API 网关」聚焦南北流量的守门人。我们拆解网关的职责清单，深入它最核心的两件事——路由与协议转换、限流与鉴权。这一章回答的是「外部世界如何安全、可控地访问我的服务」。\n\n第三章「服务网格」转向东西流量。网格把治理能力从应用代码里抽出来，下沉到与每个服务相伴的边车代理（数据面），再由控制面统一下发配置与身份。我们顺着数据面、控制面、流量管理三层，讲清网格如何让服务间通信变得可观测、可控制、可保护，而应用本身几乎无感。\n\n第四章「进阶」处理网格落地后真正棘手的三件事：用 mTLS 与 SPIFFE 身份构建零信任、用 OpenTelemetry 和黄金信号让分布式调用可观测、以及 2024 年至今最大的架构变化——Istio Ambient 与 Cilium eBPF 带来的「无边车」浪潮，它正在重写数据面的部署形态。\n\n四章是一条从概念到机制再到前沿的递进线：先知道是什么、在哪、归谁管，再分别钻进网关与网格的内部，最后站到正在发生的范式转移上。读完应能在一张架构图上准确指出每个组件的位置，并解释一个外部请求穿过网关、进入网格、抵达服务的全过程。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/api-gateway-service-mesh/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"gateway-mesh-overview","title":"网关与网格概念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/api-gateway-service-mesh/foundations/gateway-mesh-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"north-south-east-west","title":"南北与东西流量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/api-gateway-service-mesh/foundations/north-south-east-west"},{"seq":3,"slug":"proxy-fundamentals","title":"代理基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/api-gateway-service-mesh/foundations/proxy-fundamentals"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"api-gateway","title":"API 网关","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/api-gateway-service-mesh/api-gateway","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"gateway-responsibilities","title":"网关职责","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/api-gateway-service-mesh/api-gateway/gateway-responsibilities"},{"seq":2,"slug":"routing-transformation","title":"路由与转换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/api-gateway-service-mesh/api-gateway/routing-transformation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"rate-limiting-auth","title":"限流与鉴权","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/api-gateway-service-mesh/api-gateway/rate-limiting-auth"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"service-mesh","title":"服务网格","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/api-gateway-service-mesh/service-mesh","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sidecar-data-plane","title":"边车与数据平面","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/api-gateway-service-mesh/service-mesh/sidecar-data-plane"},{"seq":2,"slug":"control-plane","title":"控制平面","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/api-gateway-service-mesh/service-mesh/control-plane"},{"seq":3,"slug":"traffic-management","title":"流量管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/api-gateway-service-mesh/service-mesh/traffic-management"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"advanced","title":"进阶","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/api-gateway-service-mesh/advanced","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mtls-security","title":"mTLS 与零信任","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/api-gateway-service-mesh/advanced/mtls-security"},{"seq":2,"slug":"observability-mesh","title":"网格可观测性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/api-gateway-service-mesh/advanced/observability-mesh"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sidecarless-ambient","title":"无边车与 Ambient 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/api-gateway-service-mesh/advanced/sidecarless-ambient"}]}]}